# W31d2, guest c (k10): joins a in stag0201, goes into dng204b1 alone (matz01), walks into the enemies until defeated
# (by @880) and lies there (no A: the game over's message waits for A) until @930, half of b's 60 s wait after its request
# at @900 (run b1: at @960 the wait had ended as busy a second before the offer closed); then its game over takes it home.
# (It heals from the L panel at 350 HP on the way to matz01: stag0201's mummies felled W31b's b in run d1.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until frames>=600
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@700
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control or hp<=350 fail epoch>=@700
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=900
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@700
log c in dng204b1
die until dead fail epoch>=@880
log c defeated
idle until epoch>=@930
talk until stage=stagml11
log c home
